title: With the diff on and the pencil, a click on the added row 'eleven()' of the diffed card puts the caret in line 39 of the real file (what is typed lands inside eleven() and nowhere else); a click on a removed row must not put text in a wrong line
folders: git-changes
expect-file: git-changes/src/steps.rs :: ^fn step_1\(\) -> u32 \{\n    1\n\}\n\nfn step_2\(\) -> u32 \{\n    let two = 2;\n    two\n\}\n[\s\S]*fn step_11\(\) -> u32 \{\n    [elvn]*X[elvn()]*\n\}\n\nfn step_12\(\) -> u32 \{\n    12\n\}\n\nfn step_13\(\) -> u32 \{\n    13\n\}\n\nfn step_14\(\) -> u32 \{\n    14\n\}\n$
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left changes
goto src/steps.rs
wait 1000
zoom 0.5
diff on
wait 1500
tool edit
wait 300
mark 1-diff
wait 500
click 1000 606
wait 1000
mark 2-clicked-added-row
wait 500
type X
wait 500
key save
wait 1200
key escape
wait 1200
mark 3-typed-and-saved
wait 500
click 985 594
wait 1000
mark 4-clicked-removed-row
wait 500
quit
wait 1000
answer Close without saving
wait 800
